      "parent_id": 5.004150545592033e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500379159965618178",
      "text": "@jlpauk @Tom_sveb @rui_xu @flavius217 He admitted they stole cigars to DOJ &amp; StL County PD. He wasn't charged b/c he didn't commit a crime.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 20:31:02 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.0037849248825344e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500415054559203329",
      "text": "@flavius217 @Tom_sveb @spants @rui_xu So no matter that evidence comes out during the investigation that's what you're going with?",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 22:53:40 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.004075711536947e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500316587333652480",
      "text": "@jlpauk @spants @rui_xu @flavius217 and not releasing any facts is a real good way to make sure people pass judgment on the facts they have",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 16:22:24 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.003151905297736e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500320873086476288",
      "text": "@jlpauk @spants @rui_xu @flavius217 it is! I both argued that the Supreme Court was wrong . . .",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 16:39:26 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.003201312395182e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500321014816210944",
      "text": "@jlpauk @spants @rui_xu @flavius217 and that suppressing or selectively releasing info led to people deciding for themselves.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 16:40:00 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.003201312395182e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500320401369870336",
      "text": "@jlpauk @spants @rui_xu @flavius217 they've systematically only released information that makes them look good, even info that might taint",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 16:37:33 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.0031879486296064e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500322465323974656",
      "text": "@flavius217 White or Black the biggest prob people have with police is the attitude from cops. We are a guilty till proven innocent society.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 16:45:45 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.003214055407862e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500321569907150848",
      "text": "@jlpauk @spants @rui_xu @flavius217 an investigative report on the shooting?",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 16:42:12 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.0032105319786496e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500386029791371267",
      "text": "@FortClank it sure did. A boon to my #brand",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 20:58:20 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.003858941349929e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500407571153694720",
      "text": "@jlpauk @Tom_sveb @spants @rui_xu dude, come on. This rogue cop apparently thought he was Judge Dredd and murdered an unarmed kid.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 22:23:56 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.0040594725300634e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500319577268842496",
      "text": "“@flavius217: It appears that #Ferguson PD are trying to assassinate Mike Brown's character after literally assassinating Mike Brown.”",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 16:34:17 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.0030700162974515e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500320602520293376",
      "text": "@flavius217 Agree. Not worth the bullets whatsoever.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 16:38:21 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.003203690569482e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500406892644937728",
      "text": "@Tom_sveb @spants @rui_xu @flavius217 They didn't say who fired the shots in the car. The fact is we've only heard one side.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 22:21:14 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.004058187692851e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500400890126155777",
      "text": "@spants @Tom_sveb @rui_xu @flavius217 Has that info came out yet?",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 21:57:23 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.004001010978898e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500405947253006339",
      "text": "@flavius217 @Tom_sveb @spants @rui_xu I do, but do you have a basic understanding of the judicial system? Let's hear both sides then decide.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 22:17:29 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.004052507556905e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500323321519800321",
      "text": "@flavius217 Perhaps they need to alter/improve their training.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 16:49:10 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.003227067606917e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500406011543703552",
      "text": "@spants @flavius217 ok",
